    CONSIDER `the company is an RTE company within Chapter 1 of Part 1 of the Leasehold Reform, Housing and Urban Development Act 1993`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“RTE companies” has the same meaning as in Chapter 1 of Part 1 of the Leasehold Reform, Housing and Urban Development Act 1993" (the borrowed definition says no, supplied as an input)
